0,Varhadi-Nagpuri - vah (Indo-European) - PeopleGroups.org,https://peoplegroups.org/language/vah/,"Varhadi-Nagpuri (vah) is part of the Indo-European family and Indo-European, Indo-Iranian, Indo-Aryan, Outer Languages, Southern, Unclassified class. Varhadi-Nagpuri speaking People Groups across the world: Fast Facts: Types.",Varhadi-Nagpuri,Indo-European
1,Varhadi-Nagpuri Language (VAH)... | Ethnologue Free,https://www.ethnologue.com/language/vah/,"Varhadi-Nagpuri is a stable indigenous language of India. It belongs to the Indo-European language family. Direct evidence is lacking, but the language is thought to be used as a first language by all in the ethnic community. It is not known to be taught in schools.",Varhadi-Nagpuri,Indo-European
2,Varhadi-Nagpuri | Accent Network,https://accentnetwork.com/varhadi-nagpuri/,"Indo-European. Varhadi-Nagpuri, India. Vidarbha Chi Jaan – The Spirit of Vidarbha. Get a quote.Media consumption in Varhadi-Nagpuri-speaking areas includes a mix of traditional folk arts and modern digital platforms. Regional cinema and music are particularly popular.",Varhadi-Nagpuri,Indo-European
3,Varhadi-Nagpuri language resources | Joshua Project,https://joshuaproject.net/languages/vah,Listing of people groups speaking Varhadi-Nagpuri. Varhadi-Nagpuri dialects and alternate names. Bible and ministry resource availability.,Varhadi-Nagpuri,Indo-European
