5,The ASJP Database - Wordlist Varhadi Nagpuri,https://asjp.clld.org/languages/VARHADI_NAGPURI,Wordlist Varhadi Nagpuri. JSON. RDF serialized as n3. Grierson 1905. Indo-Aryan family: Southern group: Specimens of the Marāṭhī language (Linguistic Survey of India VII).,Varhadi-Nagpuri,Indo-European
6,"Varhadi, Nagpuri (वऱ्हाडी नागपुरी बाइबिल) | South Asia Bibles",https://southasiabibles.com/resource/language/varhadi-nagpuri,"Varhadi or Varhadi-Nagpuri is a nonstandard dialect of Marathi spoken in Vidarbha region of Maharashtra and by Marathi people of adjoining parts of Madhya Pradesh, Chhattisgarh and Telangana in India.",Varhadi-Nagpuri,Indo-European
